  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Geek, fag, stupid loser, find a rope to hang",
          "rhyme": "#g",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I'm not bipolar, see I'm just known by those couple names",
          "rhyme": "am",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I wanna tell my pops but, shit, he'll probably say the same",
          "rhyme": "am",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Fuck",
          "rhyme": "yk",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Hated by everyone, that's the way it seems",
          "rhyme": "Em",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I don't know what's shorter, his damn temper or my self-esteem",
          "rhyme": "Em",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "I sit in my room and I listen to tunes, I'm amused alone",
          "rhyme": "On",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "'Cause none of the cool kids would let me join a team",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Depression's on the stalk again",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "My best friend's an inhaler because it will not let me cough",
          "rhyme": "O",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Whenever I am losing oxygen, bully hand around my neck",
          "rhyme": "Ek",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "'Cause he felt disrespected when I decided to talk again",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "I brought that on myself, see, I should know my place",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "But not at lunchtime, see, I know better than to show my face",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Around them, but the day I do, it'll be everywhere",
          "rhyme": "eR",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "When I share these feelings finally, they gon' fucking care",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABBCDDEFGHIGJJKL",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABBCDDEFGEDGBBHB"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "hook",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Grab a couple friends, start a couple riots",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Crash a couple (Planes, planes, planes)",
          "rhyme": "upl",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Then, gather all the bullies, crush them motherfuckers",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Odd Future hooligans causing up a ruckus",
          "rhyme": "y",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "It's us, nigga",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I said it's us, nigga",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEE",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCDEE"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Murder, murder, m-murder the last they heard of you",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Was when I... (\"Uh\") with all them burners, you",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Think that I'm some punk bullied bitch who ain't gon' trouble you",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Well, I'm gonna burst your bubble two times if you don't mind",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Umm, \"Who are you again?\" I'm Samuel and that's Tyler",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "We came to get wild and style in these trench coats!",
          "rhyme": "Owt",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Don't start asking what's packing in these trench coats!",
          "rhyme": "Owt",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Just know if you start acting, I'm grabbing for these trench coats! (\"Umm\")",
          "rhyme": "Owt",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "My step-father called me a fag",
          "rhyme": "ag",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "I'll show him a fag, and I'll light a fire up in his ass",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "And recently, them assholes been fucking with me in class",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "So I'ma keep them motherfuckers there and make sure they pass, huh",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "My prom date, she dismissed my offer",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "So I'ma **** her and toss her in the principal's office (Tyler, I'll go with you)",
          "rhyme": "is",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Oh, now you wanna conversate with me, try to be my friend?",
          "rhyme": ")d",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "(Where are my parents at?) Don't worry, you'll probably never see them again (Again!)",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AAABCDDDEFFACGHI",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AAABCDDDEEEACFGG"
