      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Bum, bum, bum, bum, bum",
          "rhyme": "Om",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Bum, bum, bum, bum, bum",
          "rhyme": "Om",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Can we get this over?",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Bum, bum, bum, burum-rum-rum-rum, bum, bum, bum",
          "rhyme": "Om",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Bum, bum, bum-bum-bum-bum, hehe",
          "rhyme": "af",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Thank you",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "We are the Sams, and we're dead—it's just four of us",
          "rhyme": "ys",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "We come in peace, we mean no harm, and we're inglorious",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "We took their heads, but we just took back what they took from us",
          "rhyme": "ys",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "I guess we lost ours...",
          "rhyme": "uRs",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AABACDEDEF",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AABACDEDED"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_5",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Music had nothing to do with my final decision",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I just really wanted somebody to come pay me attention",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "But nobody would listen but stuffed animals that I had",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Since I was a kid, but I'm growing up, so they're missing",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "I didn't mean to hurt anybody, I'm sorry",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I wouldn't hurt a fly or consider joining the Army",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "I'm hardly ever angry, Roger Rabbit framed me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Mama, I'm the same fucking kid that you made, see?",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "I don't wanna go to jail, I just wanna go home",
          "rhyme": "om",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "And I want them fucking kids at school to just leave me alone",
          "rhyme": "On",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "And I... I hear helicopters, make 'em dip",
          "rhyme": "ip",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "I'm fucking reloaded, I told you all that I ain't taking shit",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "You better back up before this Mac start to lift up",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "I'll pump it like my inhaler when asthma begin to act up",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "The difference between us and our class is tan khakis",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "I got ninety-nine problems and all of them's being happy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        }
      ],
